Z||000000||dgroves||09-10-2001||12:37 PM||||When I first registered for PFF and wanted to post a topic or answer, all I had to do was enter my user name and the password would automatically go in when I moved the cursor to the P/W box. Now I have to enter the P/W. What did I change? How can I return to the origional way?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||09-10-2001||01:35 PM||||It has never automatically filled in your password after you have typed the username. It either fills in nothing, or both username and password for you.<P>Try this: Click <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/cgi-bin/fiero/ubbmisc.cgi?action=clearcookies" TARGET=_blank>here</A>, and restart your browser. Post a message or reply (you will have to fill in your username and password). Restart your browser again. Post a message or reply (this time, it should automatically fill in your username and password).||||reg||1
